operation requestContextMiddleware
input operation requestContextMiddleware request HttpRequest
input operation requestContextMiddleware response HttpResponse
output operation requestContextMiddleware MiddlewareControl
effect requestContextMiddleware read http.request.path
effect requestContextMiddleware read http.request.header
effect requestContextMiddleware write http.response
effect requestContextMiddleware allocate heap
effect requestContextMiddleware write memory.buffer
memory requestContextMiddleware heap yes
async requestContextMiddleware no
useCapability requestContextMiddleware httpRequestReader
useCapability requestContextMiddleware httpResponseWriter
useCapability requestContextMiddleware heapAllocCapability
useCapability requestContextMiddleware memoryBufferReadWriteCapability
useCapability requestContextMiddleware bcryptHashCompute
purpose operation requestContextMiddleware "Stamp request-context headers and document request-id extraction fallback before each routed handler."
invariant operation requestContextMiddleware "Request-id generation and dynamic-envelope seeding live in app helpers; static wire envelopes keep their compiled fallback id until dynamic formatting covers every error body."
label startRequestContextMiddleware
storage local immutable requestCounterStep CSignedInt64 1
call incrementRequestCounterCall math.addI64
argument incrementRequestCounterCall left I64 metricsHttpRequestsTotal
argument incrementRequestCounterCall right I64 requestCounterStep
run incrementRequestCounterCall
bind value nextHttpRequestsTotal CSignedInt64 incrementRequestCounterCall
set storage metricsHttpRequestsTotal nextHttpRequestsTotal
call stampRequestIdCall helpers.stampRequestIdHeader
argument stampRequestIdCall request HttpRequest request
argument stampRequestIdCall response HttpResponse response
run stampRequestIdCall
ignore void source stampRequestIdCall
call pathReadCall http.requestPath
argument pathReadCall request HttpRequest request
run pathReadCall
bind value requestPath CNullTerminatedByteString pathReadCall
storage local immutable pathHeaderName CNullTerminatedByteString "X-Route-Path"
call pathHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument pathHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument pathHeaderCall name CNullTerminatedByteString pathHeaderName
argument pathHeaderCall value CNullTerminatedByteString requestPath
run pathHeaderCall
ignore value source pathHeaderCall type CSignedInt32
return value continueMiddlewareControl
